 there?","The host:\n[item]aybe you should talk to someone from there. That guy over there comes from that area.",":If anything should go wrong during your trip, you have to turn back, y'understand?",":If you want to hear the old tales about the area, ask that old timer over there!","The host:\nHe's retired now, but he used to be a famous scholar. I was even one of his admirers.","The savage fighter:","The demons in this area are unbelievable. They're stronger than anywhere else!","The savage fighter:\nYeeaaah!\nI'm soooo wild!","GJust to make it into the catacombs you have to defeat a demon! Nobody can do it!","The old timer:\nThe land of Foresia lies to the north. It's sometimes called the forbidden land...","The old timer:\nThe folks who live around here never go near that area. Only fearless adventurers go there readily!","The mohican:\nMake sure that you don't forget to pick up any weapons or shields that you find - you'll surely need them!","The mohican:\n...Me?\nMy body is my weapon and my shield!","The old drunk:\nHoo, the gin here shhuure's good! Join me for a drink!","The old drunk:\nThe ale here is stinkin' expensive!","The old drunk:\nI, I'm not druunk. Hickup!","The herb girl:\nWelcome.\nDo you want to replenish your herb supply?",">\n*\n&The herb girl:\nHere you go!","The herb girl:\nJust call on me if you need anything.","You receive herbs!","The herb girl:\nGood luck!","The herb girl:\nGood day!","The herb girl:\nI think you've already got enough herbs.","The herb girl:\nSorry...\nI've got other customers to serve...","The herb girl:\nCould you come back later?","Do you know any good adventure stories?Do you know any good adventure stories?Innkeeper, do you have any good adventure stories?Innkeeper, do you have any good adventure stories?I don't suppose you've got any good stories to tell?I don't suppose you've got any good stories to tell?Hey mister, ya got any good adventure stories for us?Hey mister, ya got any good adventure stories for us?Is there a place around here to go adventuring?Is there a place around here to go adventuring?So do you have any adventure stories to tell?Do you know any good tales of adventure?Where could one fight monsters around here?Where could one fight monsters around here?... might you have a good adventure story?... might you have a good adventure story?I should probably gather information first, shouldn't I?I should probably gather information first, shouldn't I?First I need to gather some more information, right?I should try to find out more information first, right?Maybe it would be good to find out more information...Hmmm, first I'll try to gather some more information.Oh! I need to know more before I go out there!Oh! I need to know more before I go out there!I'm not ready yet, I need more information first.I'm not ready yet, first I need to get more information.I need to hear more about the adventure first.I need to hear more about the adventure first.I'm not ready to seek out adventure, I need more information.I'm just not ready to seek out adventure, I need more information....I need more information......I need more information...Sure.\nNo thanks.Sure.\nNo thanks.Yes, please.\nNo thanks, it's not necessary.Yes, please.\nNo thanks, it's not necessary.I think I will.\nNot right now.I think I will.\nNot right now.Oh yeah!\nNah.Oh yeah!\nNah.Good idea.\nNo, I'm all set.Good idea.\nNo, I'm all set.Certainly.\nThanks, but no thanks.Certainly.\nThanks, but no thanks.I need to.\nNo, I'm not interested.I need to.\nNo, I'm not interested.... yes.\n... no thanks.... yes.\n... no thanks.9========<>?4=t:\n|6t1lCtDL1d3<\n(F8\nx@<Y\\.[item],6\n_\nPd^UdD=,d,&#BOGe&(Z\n84tdDddD","yL2dddzL2dd,--\n,,$,--\n,,$,   $\n,[item])\n\n\n[item]\n[item]-\n[item]\n[item]\n--\n[item]\n[item]\n[item]\n[item]\n]^_[item]\\\n]^_[item]\\\n]^_[item]\\\n]^_[item]\\\n[item](,P$ !\n[item]*\n[item]*\n#[item]+\n[item]*\n%[item])'\n]^_[item]\\\n]^_[item]\\\n]^_[item]\\\n]^_[item]\\\n[item]1\n.[item]/\n]^_[item]\\